By bringing the forces of entropy to bear on a target, you prophesize their inevitable doom. Each point in this talent unlocks additional prophecies. A target can only be affected by a single prophecy at a time.

* Level 1: Prophecy of Ruin. Deals [71, 96, 115, 131, 145 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage on falling below 75%, 50% or 25% of maximum life.
* Level 3: Prophecy of Treason. [10%, 15%, 18%, 22%, 25% (TL1-5)] chance each turn to attack an ally or themselves.
* Level 5: Prophecy of Madness. Increases talent cooldowns by [15%, 23%, 29%, 35%, 40% (TL1-5)].
